#: qtris/gui/dialogs/__init__.py:640
msgid ""
"<b>Humble Bundle Authentication via cookie import</b>\n"
"\n"
"<b>In Firefox</b>\n"
"- Install the following extension: <a href='https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/"
"firefox/addon/export-cookies-txt/'>https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/"
"addon/export-cookies-txt/</a>\n"
"- Open a tab to humblebundle.com and make sure you are logged in.\n"
"- Click the cookie icon in the top right corner, next to the settings menu\n"
"- Check 'Prefix HttpOnly cookies' and click 'humblebundle.com'\n"
"- Open the generated file and paste the contents below. Click OK to finish.\n"
"- You can delete the cookies file generated by Firefox\n"
"- Optionally, <a href='https://support.humblebundle.com/hc/en-us/requests/"
"new'>open a support ticket</a> to ask Humble Bundle to fix their "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"<b>Humble Bundle-autentisering genom import av cookies</b>\n"
"\n"
"<b>I Firefox</b>\n"
"- Installera följande tillägg: <a href='https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/"
"firefox/addon/export-cookies-txt/'>https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/"
"addon/export-cookies-txt/</a>\n"
"- Öppna humblebundle.com i en flik och kontrollera att du är inloggad.\n"
"- Klicka på cookie-ikonen uppe till höger, bredvid inställningsmenyn.\n"
"- Markera ”Prefix HttpOnly cookies” och klicka på ”humblebundle.com”.\n"
"- Öppna den skapade filen och klistra in innehållet nedan. Klicka på OK för "
"att slutföra.\n"
"- Du kan ta bort cookie-filen som Firefox skapade.\n"
"- Du kan även <a href='https://support.humblebundle.com/hc/en-us/requests/"
"new'>öppna ett supportärende</a> och be Humble Bundle att korrigera sin "
"konfiguration."

