#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:75
msgid "Patches"
msgstr "Patchar"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:77
msgid ""
"Instead of autodetecting patches used by this game, force emulation of "
"certain patches.\n"
"\n"
"Available patches:\n"
"<b>common-this</b>: \"This Event\" in common events<b>dynrpg</b>: DynRPG "
"patch by Cherry<b>key-patch</b>: Key Patch by Ineluki<b>maniac</b>: Maniac "
"Patch by BingShan<b>pic-unlock</b>: Pictures are not blocked by "
"messages<b>rpg2k3-cmds</b>: Support all RPG Maker 2003 event commands in any "
"version of the engine\n"
"\n"
"You can provide multiple patches or use 'none' to disable all engine patches."
msgstr ""
"Istället för att autodetektera patchar som används av detta spel, tvinga "
"fram emulering av vissa patchar.\n"
"\n"
"Tillgängliga patchar:\n"
"<b>common-this</b>: \"Denna händelse\" i vanliga händelser<b>dynrpg</b>: "
"DynRPG patch av Cherry<b>key-patch</b>: Key Patch av Ineluki<b>maniac</b>: "
"Maniac Patch av BingShan<b>pic-unlock</b>: Bilder blockeras inte av "
"meddelanden<b>rpg2k3-cmds</b>: Stödjer alla RPG Maker 2003-händelsekommandon "
"i alla versioner av motorn\n"
"\n"
"Du kan ange flera patchar eller använda 'none' för att inaktivera alla "
"motorpatchar."

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:92 qtris/runners/scummvm.py:276
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Språk"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:93
msgid "Load the game translation in the language/LANG directory."
msgstr "Läs in spelöversättningen från katalogen language/LANG."

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:98 qtris/runners/zdoom.py:46
msgid "Save path"
msgstr "Sökväg för sparfiler"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:101
msgid ""
"Instead of storing save files in the game directory they are stored in the "
"specified path. The directory must exist."
msgstr ""
"I stället för att lagra sparfiler i spelkatalogen lagras de i den angivna "
"sökvägen. Mappen måste finnas."

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:108
msgid "New game"
msgstr "Nytt spel"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:109
msgid "Skip the title scene and start a new game directly."
msgstr "Hoppa över inledningsscenen och starta ett nytt spel direkt."

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:115
msgid "Load game ID"
msgstr "ID för sparfil att läsa in"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:116
msgid ""
"Skip the title scene and load SaveXX.lsd.\n"
"Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Hoppa över titelscenen och läs in SaveXX.lsd.\n"
"Ange 0 för att inaktivera."

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:125
msgid "Record input"
msgstr "Spela in inmatning"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:126
msgid "Records all button input to the specified log file."
msgstr "Spelar in alla knapptryckningar i den angivna loggfilen."

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:132
msgid "Replay input"
msgstr "Spela upp inmatning"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:134
msgid ""
"Replays button input from the specified log file, as generated by 'Record "
"input'.\n"
"If the RNG seed and the state of the save file directory is also the same as "
"it was when the log was recorded, this should reproduce an identical run to "
"the one recorded."
msgstr ""
"Spelar upp knappinmatning från den angivna loggfilen, skapad med ”Spela in "
"inmatning”.\n"
"Om slumptalsgeneratorns startvärde och sparfilskatalogens tillstånd är samma "
"som när loggen spelades in bör körningen bli identisk med den inspelade."

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:143 qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:152
#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:161 qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:176
#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:188 qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:200
msgid "Debug"
msgstr "Felsökning"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:144
msgid "Test play"
msgstr "Testspel"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:145
msgid "Enable TestPlay (debug) mode."
msgstr "Aktivera TestPlay-läget (felsökningsläge)."

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:153
msgid "Hide title"
msgstr "Dölj titelskärm"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:154
msgid "Hide the title background image and center the command menu."
msgstr "Dölj bakgrundsbilden för rubriken och centrera kommandomenyn."

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:162
msgid "Start map ID"
msgstr "Startkartans ID"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:164
msgid ""
"Overwrite the map used for new games and use MapXXXX.lmu instead.\n"
"Set to 0 to disable.\n"
"\n"
"Incompatible with 'Load game ID'."
msgstr ""
"Skriv över den karta som används för nya spel och använd MapXXXX.lmu "
"istället.\n"
"Sätt till 0 för att inaktivera.\n"
"\n"
"Inkompatibel med \"Ladda spel-ID\"."

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:177
msgid "Start position"
msgstr "Startposition"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:179
msgid ""
"Overwrite the party start position and move the party to the specified "
"position.\n"
"Provide two numbers separated by a space.\n"
"\n"
"Incompatible with 'Load game ID'."
msgstr ""
"Skriv över partiets startposition och flytta partiet till den angivna "
"positionen.\n"
"Ange två siffror åtskilda av ett mellanslag.\n"
"\n"
"Oförenlig med \"Ladda spel-ID\"."

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:189
msgid "Start party"
msgstr "Startgrupp"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:191
msgid ""
"Overwrite the starting party members with the actors with the specified "
"IDs.\n"
"Provide one to four numbers separated by spaces.\n"
"\n"
"Incompatible with 'Load game ID'."
msgstr ""
"Ersätt startgruppens medlemmar med rollfigurerna med de angivna ID-numren.\n"
"Ange ett till fyra tal avgränsade med mellanslag.\n"
"\n"
"Kan inte användas tillsammans med ”Läs in spel-ID”."

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:201
msgid "Battle test"
msgstr "Stridstest"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:202
msgid "Start a battle test with the specified monster party."
msgstr "Starta ett stridstest med den angivna monstergruppen."

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:212
msgid "AutoBattle algorithm"
msgstr "AutoBattle-algoritmen"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:214
msgid ""
"Which AutoBattle algorithm to use.\n"
"\n"
"<b>RPG_RT</b>: The default RPG_RT compatible algorithm, including RPG_RT "
"bugs.\n"
"<b>RPG_RT+</b>: The default RPG_RT compatible algorithm, with bug-fixes.\n"
"<b>ATTACK</b>: Like RPG_RT+ but only physical attacks, no skills."
msgstr ""
"Vilken AutoBattle-algoritm som ska användas.\n"
"\n"
"<b>RPG_RT</b>: Den standardalgoritm som är kompatibel med RPG_RT, inklusive "
"RPG_RT-fel.\n"
"<b>RPG_RT+</b>: Den standardalgoritm som är kompatibel med RPG_RT, med "
"felrättningar.\n"
"<b>ATTACK</b>: Som RPG_RT+, men endast fysiska attacker och inga färdigheter."

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:221 qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:240
msgid "RPG_RT"
msgstr "RPG_RT"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:222 qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:241
msgid "RPG_RT+"
msgstr "RPG_RT+"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:223
msgid "ATTACK"
msgstr "ATTACK"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:232
msgid "EnemyAI algorithm"
msgstr "Algoritm för fiendens AI"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:234
msgid ""
"Which EnemyAI algorithm to use.\n"
"\n"
"<b>RPG_RT</b>: The default RPG_RT compatible algorithm, including RPG_RT "
"bugs.\n"
"<b>RPG_RT+</b>: The default RPG_RT compatible algorithm, with bug-fixes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vilken EnemyAI-algoritm som ska användas.\n"
"\n"
"<b>RPG_RT</b>: Den RPG_RT-kompatibla standardalgoritmen, inklusive RPG_RT-"
"buggar.\n"
"<b>RPG_RT+</b>: Den RPG_RT-kompatibla standardalgoritmen, med buggfixar.\n"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:250
msgid "RNG seed"
msgstr "Startvärde för slumptalsgenerator"

#: qtris/runners/easyrpg.py:251
msgid ""
