msgstr "Wine"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:201
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:210
msgid "The game's main EXE file"
msgstr "Spelets huvudsakliga EXE-fil"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:216
msgid "Windows command line arguments used when launching the game"
msgstr "Kommandoradsargument i Windows som används vid start av spelet"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:230
msgid "Wine prefix"
msgstr "Wine-prefix"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:233
msgid ""
"The prefix used by Wine.\n"
"It's a directory containing a set of files and folders making up a confined "
"Windows environment."
msgstr ""
"Prefixet som används av Wine.\n"
"Det är en katalog som innehåller en uppsättning filer och mappar som utgör "
"en avgränsad Windows-miljö."

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:241
msgid "Prefix architecture"
msgstr "Prefixarkitektur"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:242
msgid "32-bit"
msgstr "32-bitars"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:242
msgid "64-bit"
msgstr "64-bitars"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:244
msgid "The architecture of the Windows environment"
msgstr "Arkitekturen i Windows-miljön"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:249
msgid "Integrate system files in the prefix"
msgstr "Integrera systemfiler i prefixet"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:253
msgid ""
"Place 'Documents', 'Pictures', and similar files in your home folder, "
"instead of keeping them in the game's prefix. This includes some saved games."
msgstr ""
"Placera \"Dokument\", \"Bilder\" och liknande filer i din hemmapp, istället "
"för att ha dem i spelets prefix. Detta inkluderar vissa sparade spel."

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:262
msgid "Wine version"
msgstr "Wine-version"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:268
msgid ""
"The version of Wine used to launch the game.\n"
"Using the last version is generally recommended, but some games work better "
"on older versions."
msgstr ""
"Den version av Wine som används för att starta spelet.\n"
"Att använda den senaste versionen rekommenderas i allmänhet, men vissa spel "
"fungerar bättre med äldre versioner."

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:275
msgid "Custom Wine executable"
msgstr "Anpassad körbar fil för Wine"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:278
msgid ""
"The Wine executable to be used if you have selected \"Custom\" as the Wine "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Den körbara Wine-filen som ska användas om du har valt ”Anpassad” som Wine-"
"version."

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:282
msgid "Use system winetricks"
msgstr "Använd systemets winetricks"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:286
msgid "Switch on to use /usr/bin/winetricks for winetricks."
msgstr "Aktivera /usr/bin/winetricks för att använda winetricks."

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:291
msgid "Enable DXVK"
msgstr "Aktivera DXVK"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:295
msgid "DXVK"
msgstr "DXVK"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:298
msgid ""
"Use DXVK to increase compatibility and performance in Direct3D 11, 10 and 9 "
"applications by translating their calls to Vulkan."
msgstr ""
"Använd DXVK för att öka kompatibiliteten och prestandan i Direct3D 11-, 10- "
"och 9-program genom att översätta deras anrop till Vulkan."

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:306
msgid "DXVK version"
msgstr "DXVK-version"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:319
msgid "Enable VKD3D"
msgstr "Aktivera VKD3D"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:322
msgid "VKD3D"
msgstr "VKD3D"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:325
msgid ""
"Use VKD3D to enable support for Direct3D 12 applications by translating "
"their calls to Vulkan."
msgstr ""
"Använd VKD3D för att aktivera stöd för Direct3D 12-program genom att "
"översätta deras anrop till Vulkan."

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:330
msgid "VKD3D version"
msgstr "VKD3D-versionen"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:342
msgid "Enable D3D Extras"
msgstr "Aktivera D3D Extras"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:347
msgid ""
"Replace Wine's D3DX and D3DCOMPILER libraries with alternative ones. Needed "
"for proper functionality of DXVK with some games."
msgstr ""
"Ersätt Wines D3DX- och D3DCOMPILER-bibliotek med alternativa bibliotek. "
"Krävs för att DXVK ska fungera korrekt med vissa spel."

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:354
msgid "D3D Extras version"
msgstr "D3D Extras-version"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:364
msgid "Enable DXVK-NVAPI / DLSS"
msgstr "Aktivera DXVK-NVAPI / DLSS"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:366
msgid "DXVK-NVAPI / DLSS"
msgstr "DXVK-NVAPI / DLSS"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:370
msgid "Enable emulation of Nvidia's NVAPI and add DLSS support, if available."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera emulering av Nvidias NVAPI och lägg till stöd för DLSS, om det "
"finns tillgängligt."

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:375
msgid "DXVK NVAPI version"
msgstr "DXVK NVAPI-version"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:386
msgid "Enable dgvoodoo2"
msgstr "Aktivera dgvoodoo2"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:391
msgid ""
"dgvoodoo2 is an alternative translation layer for rendering old games that "
"utilize D3D1-7 and Glide APIs. As it translates to D3D11, it's recommended "
"to use it in combination with DXVK. Only 32-bit apps are supported."
msgstr ""
"dgvoodoo2 är ett alternativt översättningslager för rendering av gamla spel "
"som använder D3D1-7 och Glide API:er. Eftersom det översätter till D3D11 "
"rekommenderas det att använda det i kombination med DXVK. Endast 32-"
"bitarsappar stöds."

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:399
msgid "dgvoodoo2 version"
msgstr "dgvoodoo2-versionen"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:408
msgid "Enable Esync"
msgstr "Aktivera Esync"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:414
msgid ""
"Enable eventfd-based synchronization (esync). This will increase performance "
"in applications that take advantage of multi-core processors."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera eventfd-baserad synkronisering (esync). Detta ökar prestandan i "
"program som utnyttjar processorer med flera kärnor."

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:421
msgid "Enable Fsync"
msgstr "Aktivera Fsync"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:427
msgid ""
"Enable futex-based synchronization (fsync). This will increase performance "
"in applications that take advantage of multi-core processors. Requires "
"kernel 5.16 or above."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera futex-baserad synkronisering (fsync). Detta ökar prestandan i "
"program som utnyttjar flerkärniga processorer. Kräver kärna "
"5.16 eller senare."

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:435
msgid "Enable AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution (FSR)"
msgstr "Aktivera AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution (FSR)"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:439
msgid ""
"Use FSR to upscale the game window to native resolution.\n"
"Requires Qtris Wine FShack >= 6.13 and setting the game to a lower "
"resolution.\n"
"Does not work with games running in borderless window mode or that perform "
"their own upscaling."
msgstr ""
"Använd FSR för att skala upp spelfönstret till ursprunglig upplösning.\n"
"Kräver Qtris Wine FShack >= 6.13 och att spelet ställs in på en lägre "
"upplösning.\n"
"Fungerar inte med spel som körs i gränslöst fönsterläge eller som utför sin "
"egen uppskalning."

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:446
msgid "Enable BattlEye Anti-Cheat"
msgstr "Aktivera BattlEye Anti-Cheat"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:450
msgid ""
"Enable support for BattlEye Anti-Cheat in supported games\n"
"Requires Qtris Wine 6.21-2 and newer or any other compatible Wine build.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aktivera stöd för BattlEye Anti-Cheat i spel som stöds\n"
"Kräver Qtris Wine 6.21-2 och nyare eller någon annan kompatibel Wine-"
"byggnad.\n"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:456
msgid "Enable Easy Anti-Cheat"
msgstr "Aktivera Easy Anti-Cheat"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:460
msgid ""
"Enable support for Easy Anti-Cheat in supported games\n"
"Requires Qtris Wine 7.2 and newer or any other compatible Wine build.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aktivera stöd för Easy Anti-Cheat i spel som stöds\n"
"Kräver Qtris Wine 7.2 och nyare eller någon annan kompatibel Wine-byggnad.\n"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:466 qtris/runners/wine.py:481
msgid "Virtual Desktop"
msgstr "Virtuellt skrivbord"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:467
msgid "Windowed (virtual desktop)"
msgstr "I fönsterläge (virtuellt skrivbord)"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:474
msgid ""
"Run the whole Windows desktop in a window.\n"
"Otherwise, run it fullscreen.\n"
"This corresponds to Wine's Virtual Desktop option."
msgstr ""
"Kör hela Windows-skrivbordet i ett fönster.\n"
"Annars körs det i helskärmsläge.\n"
"Detta motsvarar Wines alternativ Virtuellt skrivbord."

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:482
msgid "Virtual desktop resolution"
msgstr "Upplösning för virtuellt skrivbord"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:488
msgid "The size of the virtual desktop in pixels."
msgstr "Storleken på det virtuella skrivbordet i pixlar."

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:492 qtris/runners/wine.py:504
#: qtris/runners/wine.py:505
msgid "DPI"
msgstr "DPI"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:493
msgid "Enable DPI Scaling"
msgstr "Aktivera DPI-skalning"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:498
msgid ""
"Enables the Windows application's DPI scaling.\n"
"Otherwise, the Screen Resolution option in 'Wine configuration' controls "
"this."
msgstr ""
"Aktiverar Windows-programmets DPI-skalning.\n"
"Annars styrs den av alternativet Skärmupplösning i ”Wine-konfiguration”."

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:510
msgid "The DPI to be used if 'Enable DPI Scaling' is turned on."
msgstr ""
"Det DPI-värde som ska användas om ”Aktivera DPI-skalning” är aktiverat."

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:514
msgid "Mouse Warp Override"
msgstr "Överskrivning av musförflyttning"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:517
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "Aktivera"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:519
msgid "Force"
msgstr "Tvinga"

#: qtris/runners/wine.py:524
msgid ""
"Override the default mouse pointer warping behavior\n"
"<b>Enable</b>: (Wine default) warp the pointer when the mouse is exclusively "
"acquired \n"
"<b>Disable</b>: never warp the mouse pointer \n"
"<b>Force</b>: always warp the pointer"
msgstr ""
"Åsidosätt standardbeteendet för ompositionering av muspekaren\n"
"<b>Aktivera</b>: (Wine-standard) ompositionera pekaren när musen används "
"exklusivt\n"
"<b>Inaktivera</b>: ompositionera aldrig muspekaren\n"
"<b>Tvinga</b>: ompositionera alltid pekaren"

